  "description": "Heap dumps for the MAUI Inspector's Memory view. Referencing this package builds Debug Android/iOS apps with .NET's diagnostics component and a diagnostic port, so the panel's \"Heap dump\" button can hand the whole managed heap to dotnet-gcdump through maui-inspector-sync — every type with counts and sizes, and the paths that keep a leaked page alive. Nothing to configure; never active in Release.",
